# Data, routing and HUD

See the Data, Honesty labels and Conventions sections of **[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)**, and the matching skill in `skills/`.

- Never commit `data/raw/`, `*.tif`, PDS `.IMG` or JP2 files. Keep static files under about 100 MB.
- Load order: `data/processed/` → `data/demo/` → `docs/contracts/`. A live API is optional; `?demo=1` loads only local files.
- Slope limits are lunar stand-ins; DTM slope matches rover tilt only weakly. Radiation is a time-based dose budget plus a DONKI banner, never a map of rocks. Walking time, suit O₂ and procedural terrain are illustrative placeholders.
- `app.js` sends the route to the HUD (`web/hud/`) with `mm:set-route`. The 2D MapLibre planner was removed; the Orbit view (`web/orbit/`) is where a landing site is picked.
- Do not edit `web/vendor/`.
